[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   step_16: fresh signed channels on the independent CODE data.
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   Everything so far uses magnitudes (d_of).  TEP's boundary makes
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   SIGNED predictions never yet tested on this data:
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   R1  repulsion sign: if the boundary deflects trajectories away
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   from the axis, in-cap comets' future aphelia should move
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   AWAY from it -- sign(theta_fut - theta_orig) > 0 in-cap,
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   tested vs out-cap and vs a binomial null.  This is the
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   comet-side analog of the anti-cap deficit and the b12
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   JFC bipolar population.
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   R2  rotation-axis coherence: the axis of each comet's
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   orig->fut aphelion rotation.  A localized structure
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   twists crossing trajectories about a shared direction;
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   random planetary kicks do not.  Mean resultant length of
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   in-cap rotation axes vs permutation.
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   R3  doubly-matched control: each in-cap comet matched to the
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   out-cap comet nearest in (q, |daa_of|) -- does d_of still
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   differ when kick magnitude AND perihelion depth are
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   held fixed?
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   R4  joint patch fit: scan the axis on the COMBINED Warsaw+CODE
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   independent data for the d-type statistic each catalogue
[2026-09-21 14:36:10 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 039]   supports, and report the joint best axis vs the TNO axis.
